{"id":"4f2af689634edc66","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency.md","title":"Consistency from a verified descent certificate","display":"lem-ordinal-descent-consistency — Consistency from a verified descent certificate","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency","aliases":["72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency"],"display":"lem-ordinal-descent-consistency — Consistency from a verified descent certificate","depends_on":["[[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]"],"source_kind":"local-formal-completion-of-existing-dependency","verification_status":"formal-interface-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-ordinal-descent-consistency — Consistency from a verified descent certificate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d0ec6804191d5a4\" href=\"?note=6d0ec6804191d5a4\" title=\"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate\">72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c3ecb3059f70f57\" href=\"?note=1c3ecb3059f70f57\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic\">72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formal-completion-of-existing-dependency"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formal-interface-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件使用算术化接口的数语法模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=1\">\\(\\iota=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2^{(1)}\">\\(\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\)</span> 检查推导的每一行均为数公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,S,T,\\kappa,\\lambda,e,b,j,h,q,\\operatorname{Desc},\\operatorname{Trans}\">\\(B,S,T,\\kappa,\\lambda,e,b,j,h,q,\\operatorname{Desc},\\operatorname{Trans}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6d0ec6804191d5a4\" href=\"?note=6d0ec6804191d5a4\" title=\"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate\">72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate</a> 的定义域。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e)\">\\(\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c3ecb3059f70f57\" href=\"?note=1c3ecb3059f70f57\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic\">72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic</a> 的对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathsf{RO}\">\\(e\\in\\mathsf{RO}\\)</span> 的模式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x_0\">\\(x=x_0\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TI}_e\">\\(\\operatorname{TI}_e\\)</span> 的固定归纳变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_b:=(f_b(x)\\ne1)\\in\\operatorname{QF}_1(E_{\\rm PR})\">\\(A_b:=(f_b(x)\\ne1)\\in\\operatorname{QF}_1(E_{\\rm PR})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq U\">\\(B\\subseteq U\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Desc}(B,T,\\kappa,e,b,j,h)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ B\\cup\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e)\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Desc}(B,T,\\kappa,e,b,j,h)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ B\\cup\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e)\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}(B,S,\\lambda,T,\\kappa,q)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ B\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(S)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trans}(B,S,\\lambda,T,\\kappa,q)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ B\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(S)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}(B,S,\\lambda,T,\\kappa,q)\\land(U\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T))\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ U\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trans}(B,S,\\lambda,T,\\kappa,q)\\land(U\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T))\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ U\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在B中证明Prog_e(A_b)：若x在域中且其每个前驱满足A_b，而f_b(x)=1，则Step给出的f_h(x)是更小的坏记号，与前驱假设矛盾。无量词TI的这个单独实例给出所有域内记号都满足A_b。Init于是排除每个矛盾证明，量化后正是Con。该推导不需要B证明e是真实良序。</p>\n<p>后两式是Trans的全称实例与经典逆否推理，再使用包含理论对有限推导的保留。证明不把程序外延相等当作B中的可证等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate","status":"resolved","id":"6d0ec6804191d5a4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate","status":"resolved","id":"6d0ec6804191d5a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,S,T,\\kappa,\\lambda,e,b,j,h,q,\\operatorname{Desc},\\operatorname{Trans}$ 取 [[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]] 的定义域。$\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e)$ 取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]] 的对任意 $e\\in\\mathsf{RO}$ 的模式。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,S,T,\\kappa,\\lambda,e,b,j,h,q,\\operatorname{Desc},\\operatorname{Trans}$ 取 [[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]] 的定义域。$\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e)$ 取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]] 的对任意 $e\\in\\mathsf{RO}$ 的模式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\iota=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_2^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"B,S,T,\\kappa,\\lambda,e,b,j,h,q,\\operatorname{Desc},\\operatorname{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e)","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathsf{RO}","display":false},{"tex":"x=x_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TI}_e","display":false},{"tex":"A_b:=(f_b(x)\\ne1)\\in\\operatorname{QF}_1(E_{\\rm PR})","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Desc}(B,T,\\kappa,e,b,j,h)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ B\\cup\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e)\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}(B,S,\\lambda,T,\\kappa,q)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ B\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(S)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}(B,S,\\lambda,T,\\kappa,q)\\land(U\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T))\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ U\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(S).","display":true}],"bytes":2163,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-332","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第4章主题：[[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]]"},{"id":"21edd49e38c96ce7","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)$ 取 [[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]]，其成员必须有PRA内可证的初始化和严格下降公式。由该证书推出一致性的接口为 [[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]]。$\\kappa$ 的量化是元量化。"},{"id":"6df5d33910671b21","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一致性转移与不可证性分别使用 [[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]] 和 [[72-lem-second-incompleteness]]。下列编码及程序的量化均为元量化；两种编码的数码不相互混用。"}],"outgoing":["6d0ec6804191d5a4","1c3ecb3059f70f57"]}